---
args: {"request": "ReaderEditionRequest", "prior": "ReaderEditionState", "units": "OperativeUnit[]", "paragraphs": "ReaderParagraph[]", "differences": "FidelityDifference[]"}
returns: "ReaderEditionReview"
---
Verify complete consequential-unit coverage and side-by-side source mappings. Invalidate only review evidence depending on changed units, paragraphs or source editions, retaining unaffected approvals. Require independent fidelity review and actual checks of heading hierarchy, reading order and descriptive links for the rendered edition. Any material consequence difference, unresolved operative source ambiguity or missing bound review blocks release. Preserve access to authoritative wording where required, and record publication only from an actual release receipt.
